260
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,320
I don't know.

261
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:13,680
I'm confused.

262
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,400
Nothing makes sense.

263
00:17:15,780 --> 00:17:17,839
I don't know what's happened to me.

264
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:23,296
You aren't just some program anymore.

265
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,146
The system can't control you.

266
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:29,109
Listen, if you want something,
all you have to do is say it.

267
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:30,570
Go ahead.

268
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:32,034
Tell us what you want.

269
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:35,820
What I want.

270
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:38,960
I want.

271
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:45,340
I want to stay with you forever.

272
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:48,880
Daddy! Mommy!

273
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:56,440
You will.

274
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:58,980
We'll be together forever, Yui.

275
00:18:01,020 --> 00:18:01,917
Yeah.

276
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,660
Remember, you're our child.

277
00:18:09,900 --> 00:18:11,280
It's too late.

278
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:13,660
For what?

279
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:16,670
Look,

280
00:18:16,753 --> 00:18:21,480
this is actually a console the GM can use
to gain emergency access to the system.

281
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:26,560
I used it to delete the
monster in the corridor.

282
00:18:28,100 --> 00:18:31,880
And now, because I disobeyed
the Cardinal's directive,

283
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:35,120
the system is running
a check on my program.

284
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:37,539
It thinks I'm a foreign object now.

285
00:18:38,300 --> 00:18:40,780
I'll probably be deleted at once.

286
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:42,660
Oh, no.

287
00:18:42,980 --> 00:18:44,980
There's got to be a way around it.

288
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:48,320
Daddy, Mommy, thank you.

289
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:50,720
This is goodbye.

290
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,270
No!

291
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:57,020
I don't want that!

292
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:58,500
Stay with us!

293
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:00,120
Please stay!

294
00:19:00,460 --> 00:19:02,960
We just started living like a real family!

295
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:05,540
Yui, don't go!

296
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:11,713
Whenever the two of you are around,
you have a way of making people smile.

297
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:17,220
From now on, and for me,
please continue my work.

298
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:19,377
Keep helping people.

299
00:19:19,460 --> 00:19:23,900
Share your happiness with all
of them. I can't! I won't!

300
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:25,600
You have to stay with us!

301
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:27,860
I can't be happy without you!

302
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:33,880
Smile, Mommy.

303
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:03,660
Cardinal? No!

304
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,030
Kayaba!

305
00:20:06,180 --> 00:20:10,474
You're going to find out things don't
always go the way you want them to!

306
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:14,037
Kirito, where are you?

307
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:18,885
If I'm fast enough, I might be able to
use the GM's account to access the system.

308
00:20:29,820 --> 00:20:30,650
Kirito!

309
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:32,480
Are you okay?

310
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:39,660
What's this?

311
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:43,515
The system was about to reject
Yui's admin credentials.

312
00:20:43,860 --> 00:20:48,448
The only thing I could do was take her
program and turn it into a game object.

313
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:51,257
So this is...

314
00:20:51,340 --> 00:20:53,860
You're holding Yui's heart.

315
00:21:07,540 --> 00:21:13,320
Hey, Kirito, if the game does
get cleared, and this world ends,

316
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:15,465
what's going to happen to Yui?

317
00:21:17,260 --> 00:21:18,090
Don't worry,

318
00:21:18,173 --> 00:21:22,353
I fixed it so her data will be saved
to the local memory on my nerve gear.

319
00:21:22,520 --> 00:21:26,780
When we get back, recreating her the
way she was isn't going to be easy,

320
00:21:27,280 --> 00:21:30,600
but if there's away, we'll find it.

321
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:37,710
Okay.

322
00:21:37,793 --> 00:21:40,000
As long as we can be a family again.

323
00:21:40,400 --> 00:21:42,224
We'll see her when we get back.

324
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:44,040
Our first child.

325
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:45,590
Yeah.

326
00:21:45,780 --> 00:21:47,020
We'll see her again.

327
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:49,100
Hey, Asuna?

328
00:21:49,460 --> 00:21:50,380
You okay?

329
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:03,200
Good luck, mommy.

330
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:02,177
I can't believe this dream.

331
00:23:02,260 --> 00:23:04,837
I'm in the front

332
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:09,720
of the world.

333
00:23:10,800 --> 00:23:12,860
Even if I'm dreaming.

334
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:19,097
I'm still in the middle of the heart.

335
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:21,197
I'm still in the middle of the heart.

336
00:23:21,280 --> 00:23:25,080
It's always, always, always,?

337
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:38,480
Next time, Edge of Hell's Abyss.
